                    <h3 style="color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Servo Sweep and Patterns</h3>
                    <p style="color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        Create automated servo movements and patterns:
