                <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    <h3 style="color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Automated Sequences and Patterns</h3>
                    <p style="color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        Create complex automated sequences that combine servo movements with musical patterns. 
